3.22.0: 🧬 Ghost DNA — shrink old projects. ⚙ → Storage shows the space each project uses. Shrink keeps each picture’s recipe (prompt + seed) and a small preview instead of the big file; 🧬 Regrow makes the full pictures and shots again and shows how close they came. Finished videos, songs and your uploads are always kept.
3.21.1: Clearer "Not enough free disk space" message: it now shows the full space an add-on needs (its size plus room to work).
3.21.0: Real moving video on your Mac, free: install ⚙ → Add-ons → AI motion (on this Mac). A dog really walks through the market, people move, the camera travels. Made on the Mac itself (no cloud, no cost per video), about 1–3 minutes per shot on recent Macs. Ghost uses Google Cloud first when it is connected, then AI motion, then photo motion.
3.20.0: Connect your company's Google Cloud (⚙ → Google Cloud): the same models as the Google Cloud console make your ads: Veo 3.1 real moving video with its own sound and lip-sync, and Gemini image pictures. All shots are made at the same time. Ghost picks the newest model your project has and stops at your monthly limit.
3.19.0: Talking pictures look alive: several mouth shapes (open, half, rounded for o/u sounds), smooth changes between them and natural eye blinks. Works for animals and people.
3.18.0: Better ads from the same idea: no more silent gaps (each shot lasts as long as its line), more and shorter shots in free mode (about 4 s each), every shot framed differently (close-up, wide, low angle…) instead of repeating one picture, and background music on by default when the Music add-on is installed.
3.17.2: Fix: Natural voices downloaded the wrong model (one your account isn't approved for). It now downloads the one you accepted. Press Try again under ⚙ → Add-ons.
3.17.1: Much faster pictures on Macs with less than 64 GB: Ghost no longer keeps several big models in memory at once (that made pictures crawl at minutes per step). Video ads use the fast picture model. Update now also works while something is being made (it pauses it; press Continue afterwards). Includes 3.17.0: safer, Regenerate/Edit, Check Ghost.
3.17.0: Safer and sturdier. Ghost now refuses requests from other websites or renamed addresses (only its own page can change things). Talk to Ghost retries when the brain is busy, tells you if an answer was cut off, and has ↻ Regenerate and ✎ Edit my message. Live results can't steer the AI. New ⚙ → Check Ghost tests every part with timings.
3.16.0: Talking pictures in free mode: each speaking character's mouth now opens and closes with its voice (people and animals). Only the mouth changes, so faces and backgrounds don't flicker. Real body action and true lip-sync still need the video service.
3.15.0: Cast setting (Auto, People, Talking animals, 3D cartoon). “A cow and a dog talk about politics” now makes a talking desi cow and an Indian street dog, with no humans. Each character gets its own voice (first voice female or male, the next one the other). Spoken lines are written in the language's own script so voices pronounce them right.
3.14.0: Talk to Ghost goes live: today's news, weather, prices and facts are looked up by itself (free) with sources you can open. Knows today's date. Remembers your earlier chats. 🧠 Deep thinking for hard questions. Optional in ⚙: your own Gemini / OpenAI / OpenRouter / Groq key for ChatGPT-level answers, and a Brave key for whole-web search.
3.13.1: Much faster pictures on Apple-chip Macs: the fast picture engine (MLX) was silently failing and falling back to a ~5x slower path; fixed. On 32 GB+ Macs the picture models stay loaded between pictures. Update now can pause a running ad for you (press Continue afterwards). Clearer Natural voices setup. Includes 3.13.0: ChatGPT-style chat in Talk to Ghost, everyday-Indian prompts, faster prompt writing.
3.13.0: Talk to Ghost now chats about anything like ChatGPT (answers stream word by word) and only acts when you ask it to make or change something. Better prompts: “One man” now gives an ordinary Indian man in an everyday place, with no gods, prayer or festival unless you ask. Faster: prompts are written about 5× faster, Fast mode uses the quickest model, models stay ready in memory.
3.12.0: Dub a video into another language (keeps the music, removes the old voice). Natural voices add-on: human-sounding Malayalam, Hindi, Tamil, English narration (female/male, warm, excited, calm, announcer). Music: cover your own tune, replace any part of a song, split stems. Smarter Talk to Ghost with Qwen 3.5 (Upgrade button in Add-ons). Removed: very slow AI motion, unused old installers and voice.
3.11.0: Talk to Ghost: tell Ghost what to do in your own words (English, Hindi, Hinglish, Malayalam). It makes, changes, retakes, undoes, rewrites and remembers, shows every action with its real result, and waits for your OK before big ones. Runs on this computer with the Script add-on.
3.10.1: Updates show up straight away (Ghost asks GitHub for the newest version directly instead of a copy that can lag minutes behind). Includes 3.10.0: Ghost understands Indian words (desi dog = real Indian street dog, auto, cutting chai, kasavu…) and remembers what you teach it (⚙ → What Ghost has learned).
3.10.0: Ghost understands Indian words: desi dog = a real Indian street dog (INDog), desi cow, auto, cutting chai, kasavu, dosa and 25 more. Teach Ghost your own words (⚙ → What Ghost has learned: "When I write X I mean Y", "Always…"). Ask for the same change twice and Ghost offers to always do it.
3.9.3: Pictures now show exactly what you ask for: "cat" gives a real cat, with no person added. People are added only when your idea mentions them (girl, family, couple, wedding…).
3.9.2: Fix: Ghost could get stuck on "Starting Ghost Studio…" for a few minutes right after an update (it kept re-downloading). It now only updates when a newer version exists.
3.9.1: Fix: Update now could stay blocked ("An ad is being made") after a project was deleted or paused mid-picture. Ghost now never gets stuck busy, and jobs cut off by a restart show as Paused with Continue.
3.9.0: ✨ Change: edit the same picture, shot or song in plain words (shorter hair, brown eyes, make it a man, blue saree, more upbeat, male voice) and keep everything else. Change one or all. ↶ Undo any change. ✨ Rewrite any script line, prompt or lyrics. New take stays separate for something completely different.
3.8.0: Check prompts first + Edit: change any prompt, lyrics or line before or after making. People are Indian by default and Indian states are recognised even when misspelled (kera = Kerala). Two simple modes: Fast and Quality. One Pictures card. With a video-service key, everything runs in the cloud at the same time (4 pictures in seconds, songs in under a minute).
3.7.0: Pause and Continue any job (keeps what is already made), remove waiting jobs from the queue, rename and delete projects. Faster: AI motion is now opt-in (it took ~40 min per shot), songs make 1 take, the script AI frees memory before pictures/music.
3.6.0: Direction styles: Interview · 2 cameras (shot/reverse-shot, 3 pictures only = fast), Cinematic film (amber/teal grade, grain, 2.39 letterbox), Newsroom explainer, Phone UGC. Styles are detected from reference ads. Faster export.
3.5.0: Video ads get the right number of shots for their length (no more one-shot ads) and a real title. Copying a reference ad now hears its speech (Script AI adds speech-to-text). Songs: shorter singable lyrics sized to the length, a proofread pass for made-up words, and better singing in every mode.
3.4.0: Big speed-up. Fixed the fast Mac picture engine (it was falling back to the slow one). New Draft / Final / Best choice: Final is now fast, Best uses the most realistic model. Music engine stays ready between songs; Draft songs compose faster.
3.3.0: Same person and place across all images. Retake keeps the main look; New take starts fresh. Pick any picture as the main look with the star.
3.2.0: Better picture quality: real shot variety (close-up, hands detail, wide…), hand/eye guidance, new Best pictures add-on (Z-Image-Turbo, higher resolution) and an automatic quality check that remakes pictures with bad hands or eyes.
3.1.0: Much faster pictures on Apple chips (native MLX engine, same model), model pre-loads in the background, time per image shown. New Script AI add-on for much better prompts and lyrics.
3.0.0: Add-ons: free Music & songs (ACE-Step, Hindi + 50 languages), AI motion video (Wan 2.2) and AI pictures, each installed once with progress. New "Music / song" mode and AI background music for video ads.
2.3.0: New "Images only" mode: choose 1 to 8 images, get a gallery with download, new take and download-all.
2.2.1: Shows the picture-model download (about 8 GB) with a progress bar, instead of downloading it silently during the first ad.
2.2.0: Install progress bar for free AI pictures. Ghost icon in the browser tab. New glowing-dots loading animation.
2.1.0: Version shown at the top. Clear update notice. Updates keep your ads, settings and whatever you are typing.
2.0.0: No Terminal: click the Ghost Studio icon and the browser opens. Stop button under the gear.
1.5.0: Frosted-glass look. Menus no longer see-through.
